@startuml ZeAI_MIIH_Lead_Template_Matched_ER_v4
title ZeAI #MadeInIndia Hackathon - Lead Template ER v4 (24 Base + 4 RBAC/CMS) (For Approval)
' Based on LabX_Complete_ER_Lead_Template_Matched_v1.3.puml styling
' Proposal only. Team registrations, configurable 4 members by default, Razorpay-link proof upload, approval + Excel exports.
hide methods
hide stereotypes
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 80
skinparam ranksep 100
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
top to bottom direction


